==English==
{{wikipedia|second (disambiguation)|second}}
{{number box|en|2}}

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sekʷ-|id=follow}}
From {{inh|en|enm|secunde}}, {{m|enm|second}}, {{m|enm|secound}}, {{m|enm|secund}}, borrowed from {{der|en|fro|second}}, {{m|fro|seond}}, from {{der|en|la|secundus||following, next in order}}, from root of {{m|la|sequor||I follow}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*sekʷ-||to follow}}. {{doublet|en|secundo}}. Displaced native {{m|en|twoth}} and partially displaced native {{m|en|other}} (from {{noncog|ang|ōþer|t=other; next; second}}).

