===Etymology===
{{inh+|fr|fro|secunt}}, {{m|fro|second}}, {{m|fro|segont}}, borrowed as a semi-learned term from {{bor|fr|la|secundus||second}}; related to {{m|fr|sequi||follow}}. {{doublet|fr|son|t1=bran}}, which was inherited.

