|text=« Chiquita! Chiquita! » À la '''seconde''' appellation, une fillette maigre et hâve {{...}} s'avança vers Agostin.
|translation="Chiquita! Chiquita!" At the '''second''' call, a thin and emaciated little girl {{...}} came up to Agostin}}

====Usage notes====
For added "precision and elegance", the [[French Academy]] recommends using ''second'' when only two items are being considered, reserving {{m|fr|deuxième}} for other situations, i.e. when more than two items are being considered;<ref name="FA">http://www.academie-francaise.fr/second-deuxieme</ref> although this rule is not mandatory.<ref name="FA"/> The Academy however advises against ever replacing ''second'' with ''deuxième'' in fixed idioms such as {{m|fr|de seconde main}} or {{m|fr|seconde nature}}.<ref name="FA"/>

